  "idea": "Penpot: the free open-source Figma alternative for design teams",
  "text": "How teams are migrating from expensive design tools to this open-source workspace. Growing design teams quickly run into enterprise tiers charging hundreds of dollars per user every month. Agencies end up restricting collaboration just to avoid triggering expensive pricing tiers. Instead, deploy Penpot using Docker or their free cloud workspace to manage projects without user limits. You scale client deliverables with zero subscription creep.",
